        "params": {
          "text": "TAKE ON ME — a-ha (1985)\n\nIconic synth-pop riff recreation.\n\n- Riff: Step sequencer → Square wave + chorus + delay\n- Bass: Step sequencer → Saw osc → Ladder filter (24dB)\n- Drums: 909 kit (kick, snare, hihat, clap)\n- Pads: Chord seq → Supersaw → LP filter\n\nTempo: 169 BPM\nKey: A major (Bm-E-A-F#m progression)\n\nAdjust chorus depth and delay feedback for different vibes."
